WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Can area under a graph be negative?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.980
Above the axis counts as positive.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.310
Below the axis counts as negative.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:14.016
So pieces can cancel. Velocity below zero means moving backwards.
